se randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nMrs. Zhao and her husband live with the elders in their family, their family is affluent, life is happy, and everyone is in harmony. Her husband loves her very much, she receives a special gift from her husband on her wedding anniversary: a romantic seaside vacation for the weekend.\n\n[Question]\nMrs. Zhao should be surprised by her husband's romantic gift, but why does she actually appear anxious?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Mrs. Zhao has important plans at work and worries about them being disrupted.\nB. Mrs. Zhao is anxious about the cost of the vacation, worrying that it may affect their family's financial situation.\nC. Mrs. Zhao worries about her husband's behavior, suspecting that he may have something to hide.\nD. Mrs. Zhao worries that no one takes care of the pets and plants at home when they leave.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004069975193947189,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e353d6006945d2804e6b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368339025,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:38:59","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"d5970d6c7cb44994add2e33169def41f"}